{"id":6677423742,"name":"Five Nights At Your Friends [FNAF]","desc":"⚠️ [HUGE UPDATES COMING SOON] ⚠️\n\nCan you survive a night against your friends?\nThis game is basically FNAF but allows you to make the animatronics your friends :D\n\nThis is a fan game of Five Nights at Freddy's.\n\nTags: FNAF, Horror, Five Nights At Freddy's, FNAF Roblox, Friends, Scary","path":"/game/6677423742-five-nights-at-your-friends","slug":"6677423742-five-nights-at-your-friends","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b47dd6f8245b3b744429f0e5f0f06278ead9be0e0fd4f0ff20d2fc27d3c071ef.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-56557ee68d14b7de473d866ba39be612/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":42,"visitor":27763459,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-02-20T15:54:57.436Z","creator":{"name":"Five Nights at Your Friends","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"67b75051813b8a301dd5b2cc","title":"Animatronic highlight","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78af2","gameId":6677423742,"name":"Five Nights At Your Friends [FNAF]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b47dd6f8245b3b744429f0e5f0f06278ead9be0e0fd4f0ff20d2fc27d3c071ef.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-56557ee68d14b7de473d866ba39be612/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"6677423742-five-nights-at-your-friends","path":"/game/6677423742-five-nights-at-your-friends","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b47dd6f8245b3b744429f0e5f0f06278ead9be0e0fd4f0ff20d2fc27d3c071ef.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-56557ee68d14b7de473d866ba39be612/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":6677423742},"slug":"Five-Nights-At-Your-Friends-FNAF-Animronic-highlight-29855","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":10114,"executes":153,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-36a73bffd4196e3c01f92816f1508fcd/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-36a73bffd4196e3c01f92816f1508fcd/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-36a73bffd4196e3c01f92816f1508fcd/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-36a73bffd4196e3c01f92816f1508fcd/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter"},"likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-02-20T15:54:57.436Z","updatedAt":"2025-02-20T15:54:57.436Z","lastBump":"2025-02-20T15:54:57.436Z","script":"local workspace = game:GetService(\"Workspace\")\n\nlocal function createHighlight(character)\n\n    if not character:FindFirstChild(\"Highlight\") then\n        local highlight = Instance.new(\"Highlight\")\n        highlight.Parent = character \n        highlight.FillColor = Color3.new(1, 0, 0) \n        highlight.FillTransparency = 0.5 \n        highlight.OutlineColor = Color3.new(0, 0, 0) \n        highlight.OutlineTransparency = 0 \n    end\nend\n\nfor _, character in pairs(workspace.Characters:GetChildren()) do\n\n    if character:IsA(\"Model\") and character:FindFirstChildOfClass(\"Humanoid\") then\n        createHighlight(character) \n    end\nend\n","features":"Highlights all animatronics in both parts. Re-execute the script when night starts","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6771403793a5452b6d8517cc","username":"Figure_play","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1bf6b70a3262755203a345b968aa4d7e9e609dbcc13e1085b27bd3bb6f40650e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6771403793a5452b6d8517cc-1735475396247.jpg"},"lvl":7,"status":"offline","id":"6771403793a5452b6d8517cc","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1bf6b70a3262755203a345b968aa4d7e9e609dbcc13e1085b27bd3bb6f40650e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/677140